# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "Instala el paquete cliente de workflows gestionados, autentícate en IBM Quantum Platform y verifica tu configuración."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "Instalar {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Requisitos previos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Workflows gestionados habilitados en tus [instancias de IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contacta a tu administrador para habilitarlos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Una clave de API y el CRN de tu instancia. Consulta [Encuentra tus credenciales de acceso](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 o posterior, en un entorno virtual activo. Consulta [Instalar Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) para saber cómo configurar un entorno.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Inicio rápido con skills de IA {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar los skills de IA del [repositorio de plantillas de Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) para ayudarte a instalar `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, empaquetar tu código local existente y desplegarlo como un workflow gestionado.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Instalar el paquete cliente {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "Instala el paquete `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Este comando también instala `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit` y `qiskit-ibm-runtime` como dependencias. No necesitas instalar `qiskit-serverless` por separado. Los ejemplos de estas guías requieren `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 o posterior, que instala `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 y `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Usas dos de estos paquetes directamente, en lugares distintos:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` es el cliente que usas en tu computadora local para subir workflows, ejecutarlos y obtener sus resultados.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-serverless` se ejecuta dentro del código de tu workflow. Proporciona utilidades como `get_arguments()`, `update_status()` y `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Actualizar el paquete cliente {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Como los workflows gestionados están en beta, el paquete cliente cambia con frecuencia. Para comprobar qué versión tienes, ejecuta el siguiente comando:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Para actualizar a la última versión, ejecuta el siguiente comando:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Si la nueva versión de `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requiere una versión más reciente de `qiskit-serverless`, este comando también actualiza `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "Autenticarse {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protege tu clave de API\">\n"
"No incluyas tu clave de API en el código de tu workflow, en scripts ni en archivos de notebook. Un workflow en ejecución usa las credenciales y la instancia que usaste para llamar a `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "El cliente de workflows gestionados usa las mismas credenciales que `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Si ya guardaste una cuenta con `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, el cliente carga tu cuenta guardada predeterminada y puedes saltar a [Verificar tu configuración](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Si no has guardado una cuenta, guarda tu clave de API y el CRN de tu instancia una sola vez en un entorno de confianza:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Este método escribe tus credenciales en el mismo archivo que [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). El cliente usa el canal `ibm_quantum_platform` por defecto, por lo que no necesitas establecer `channel`. Para guardar más de una cuenta, establece `name` y pasa el mismo `name` al crear el cliente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Para más opciones, como guardar varias cuentas o seleccionar una instancia automáticamente, consulta [Guardar tus credenciales de inicio de sesión](/guides/save-credentials). Si trabajas en una computadora pública u otro entorno no confiable, no guardes tus credenciales. En su lugar, sigue [Inicializar el servicio en un entorno no confiable](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "Verificar tu configuración {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Conéctate a los workflows gestionados con tu cuenta guardada y lista los workflows que subiste:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Si aún no has subido ningún workflow, la salida es una lista vacía (`[]`). Si ves un error de autenticación, el cliente no encontró credenciales válidas. Revisa la cuenta que guardaste en la sección [Autenticarse](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"- [Despliega tu primer workflow gestionado](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) para cargar un workflow, ejecutarlo y obtener su resultado.\n"
"- Para empezar con código que funciona, despliega una de las [plantillas de Qiskit Function](/guides/qiskit-function-templates) o adapta una plantilla base para tu propio workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
